  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Security Support Project in the Republic of Mali for the year 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contributing to supporting food security in the Republic of Mali by meeting the essential food needs of the neediest families in the targeted regions, by distributing 6,200 food baskets.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Distribution of 6200 food baskets consisting of (25 kg rice, 10 kg pasta, 5 liters of oil, 5 kg of sugar) to benefit 6200 families.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing access to food assistance for the most vulnerable communities in the Republic of Mali</narrative>
  </description>
